Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:08.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your teacher comes back today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:09.45,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:12.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see. Then I'd better say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:14.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Should we leave a little earlier than usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:15.96,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:25.97,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:29.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:32.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:34.81,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.81,0:00:37.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio, say "I'm going" to Mommy. {ep 19}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:41.19,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.53,0:00:44.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:56.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Ushio! {ep 19}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:00:59.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, so wait! {ep 19}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:00.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio!
