Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:29.09,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:34.89,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Stew!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.27,0:02:37.31,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Stew!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.31,0:02:38.10,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Gof! Gof!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:39.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:42.06,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,The kindergarten pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:43.52,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:45.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why a boar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:51.66,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You must be Okazaki Ushio-chan's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:54.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Y-You!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:58.58,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm Ushio-chan's teacher, Fujibayashi Kyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:01.42,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:05.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes, the pleasure is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:14.80,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've ever seen a face like that on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:17.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.31,0:03:20.18,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You should have known the moment you saw Botan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:23.56,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Or have you forgotten about me already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.15,0:03:26.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So that is Botan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.36,0:03:26.98,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Gof!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:33.91,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan, to tell you the truth,\Nyour daddy and I went to school together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:37.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She was violent back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:39.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She always bullied me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:43.50,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't make stories up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:46.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She was also a good friend of Mommy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:47.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:04:00.39,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Sanae-san came and said that you'd eventually come\Nso not to tell the whole story until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.77,0:04:04.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see... Sanae-san did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:08.61,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 20
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:08.61,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}The Tidal Breeze's Mischief
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:11.32,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Fate is pretty strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.82,0:04:14.82,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Whoever thought I'd be Ushio-chan's teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:17.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I must have made you worry a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:18.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:23.87,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It must have been hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:25.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:30.17,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ryou, Kotomi, and Youhei are all worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:36.39,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,We were thinking maybe we should visit you when we got together over New Years, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:39.05,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,We ended up saying it'd be best to leave you alone for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:40.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:46.56,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,But this means that everything's settled, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.65,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,All the loose ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:49.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:51.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How's Ushio doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:53.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is she getting along with everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.20,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,She's a really good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:58.74,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,She's not cynical like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:02.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I bet she got it from her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:06.58,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,But I'd say she's more active than her mother was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:11.96,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,She runs off on her own when I take my eyes off her, so I'm extra careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.34,0:05:13.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.92,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:17.38,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:18.09,Default-alt,Kid,0,0,0,,Good morning, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:20.55,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Good morning, Takuya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:22.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll get going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:24.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll leave Ushio with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.35,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If anything happens, call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:29.40,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:33.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be relying on you, Fujibayashi-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:37.45,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:39.74,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Your daddy's heading to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:45.75,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Have a good day, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:48.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, off I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:56.42,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad that you can live with your daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:57.72,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:01.43,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,All right, shall we go inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.43,0:06:02.14,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:05.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Fuko-chan is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:09.10,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Yeah. She wants to visit your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.85,0:06:12.19,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Do you have any plans this coming Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:14.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:15.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:19.32,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Apparently she wants to become friends with Ushio-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:22.03,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It'd help if you would let her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:27.54,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Fuko-chan just got out of hospital and needs to practice walking on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:30.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. She's going through rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.38,0:06:33.50,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,She's also shy around people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.84,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It's rare that she actively wants to meet someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.80,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I want to create such opportunities for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:42.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:07:03.16,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\be1\K50}{\K232}Na{\K8}{\K46}mi{\K34}da {\K144}ga{\K93} {\K46}ko{\K34}bo{\K183}re{\K371} {\K25}o{\K11}{\K45}chi{\K230}ru {\K43}no{\K44}ha {\K219}na{\K17}n {\K31}no {\K53}se{\K145}i
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:07:03.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\be1}What causes my tears to fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:45.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It looks like Ushio likes Fuko-chan, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll be expecting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:48.52,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:50.64,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,And thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:52.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:14.88,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\be1\K50}{\K78}Ka{\K86}sa{\K68}ne {\K44}su{\K44}gi{\K35}ta {\K31}to{\K268}shi {\K64}no{\K29} {\K211}se{\K112}i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\be1}It's from living for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:27.10,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}{\be1\K50}{\K146}I{\K95}su {\K48}ni {\K27}yu{\K38}ra{\K37}re{\K102}te{\K57} {\K38}yu{\K43}me {\K114}wo{\K42} {\K63}mi{\K12}{\K44}te {\K38}i{\K46}ta{\K30}n{\K119}da
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:27.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}{\be1}I was having a dream, sitting in a rocking chair,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:39.07,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)}{\be1\K30}{\K38}A{\K45}na{\K76}ta {\K38}ga{\K38} {\K41}chi{\K34}i{\K47}sa{\K32}na {\K66}shu{\K21}{\K39}ku{\K33}fu{\K44}ku {\K42}no {\K37}na{\K41}ka{\K36}de{\K44} {\K72}u{\K46}ma{\K39}re{\K36}te {\K44}ki{\K77}ta {\K43}hi {\K31}no
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:39.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)}{\be1}Of sunlight peaking past branches and of the happy day
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:52.54,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,750)}{\be1\K20}{\K37}Ko{\K40}mo{\K43}re{\K39}bi {\K159}wo{\K214} {\K64}shi{\K40}a{\K31}wa{\K53}se {\K39}na {\K64}hi {\K455}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:52.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,750)}{\be1}When you were born surrounded by blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:06.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Ushio. You're going to have a guest tomorrow. {ep 19}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:08.64,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:10.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ibuki Fuko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:11.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You remember her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:14.02,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.69,0:08:17.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She said she wants to play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:18.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:20.65,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup. I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:22.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're happy about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.70,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup. I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:32.29,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy. Can you sing Mommy's song?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:35.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Again? You really like it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:38.42,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup. It's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:43.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right. But it's nighttime, so quietly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:51.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Dango, dango, dango, dango...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:54.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A great big dango family!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.35,0:09:05.82,engsub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}A mischievous roasted dango, a kind sweet bean dango
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.95,0:09:14.16,engsub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Gather them all up and it’s a family of a hundred.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.54,0:09:23.80,engsub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}A baby dango is always cradled in happiness.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.17,0:09:33.01,engsub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}An old dango gazes with squinty eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.56,0:09:43.07,engsub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}The dango friends will all hold hands and form a big circle.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.15,0:09:52.78,engsub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}They’ll found a village on a dango planet and all smile together.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.78,0:10:02.13,engsub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}The rabbits are waving their hands from the big moon.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.38,0:10:12.51,engsub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Roll up all the happy and sad things...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:19.06,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko's here for a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:21.94,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Thank you for having Fuko over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:23.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.48,0:10:28.03,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Now, right off the bat, Ushio-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.03,0:10:30.36,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Be Fuko's little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:31.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, she won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:36.75,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko isn't talking to you. Fuko's talking with Ushio-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:40.79,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan. Don't you like Fuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:43.88,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:45.38,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.59,0:10:48.97,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,But I'm staying with Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:50.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:56.14,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Then Fuko will spend today to win you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:59.89,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,First, this is the gift for us getting to know each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.89,0:11:03.73,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It's a made-to-order bread by Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:06.15,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Will you eat it, Ushio-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.53,0:11:09.28,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:12.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's a pretty cute design coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:14.91,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Itadakimasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:20.62,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:25.42,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Cute Ushio-chan is eating cute bread, and her cuteness just doubled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:27.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't hug her for every reason you make up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:32.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're having lunch now. Do you want to eat with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:37.68,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Are you trying to win Fuko over?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.35,0:11:38.35,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:43.69,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko heard that you lost your wife, Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.69,0:11:44.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:48.86,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It's no surprise that you see a sliver of her in Fuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:51.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:53.11,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:58.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa doesn't resemble you at all; almost like a separate species.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:12:00.50,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You had an alien as your wife?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:01.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm saying you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:03.83,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko's not an alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:06.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't follow your thought process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:11.05,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko has an average Earthling's thought process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.05,0:12:14.93,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Neighbors often say that Fuko is a very average Earthling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:16.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What kind of neighbors do you have?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.39,0:12:19.64,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Therefore, let's go home together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:21.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That doesn't follow at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:27.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fs75.6}Besides, if you represent the average Earthling's thought process, the world would be gone in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:30.44,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko cannot understand your statement at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:35.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What would you do if there's a button in front of you that says "don't press"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:38.03,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko will hide and press it secretly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:41.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was the launch button of a nuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:44.41,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,That was not fair! You tricked Fuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:47.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The Earth would be gone in less than three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:49.88,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Then here's a question for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:56.43,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,What would you do if tights that say\N"don't wear" were lying on the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:58.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'd leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:03.39,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You're lying! Fuko's sure that, not being able to control yourself, you'd put them on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:06.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okazaki's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.32,0:13:13.32,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,The world would end because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:20.20,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It's late now, but you didn't add any sleeping pills, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:25.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even if you were sleeping your butt off, I wouldn't touch you with a six-foot pole, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:31.63,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,D-Does that mean you care about Fuko that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.63,0:13:33.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Heck no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:34.92,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You don't have to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:35.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who says?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:37.38,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:38.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Damn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.89,0:13:40.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Enough! I won't talk with you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.43,0:13:42.14,Default-alt,Fuk,0,0,0,,Are you embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:46.23,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,And so, let's play cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:50.77,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan, do you know how to play blackjack or gin rummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.77,0:13:53.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey. You're talking to a five-year old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:14:00.70,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Sorry. Fuko's an adult,\Nso Fuko suggested advanced games.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:04.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you know any games, Ushio? {ep 19}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:08.50,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Sevens!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.17,0:14:11.79,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan, best choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:13.75,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,That is an addictive game!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're such a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:20.18,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san. You're holding on to the ten of hearts, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:23.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Well, since I still have lots of card I can play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.18,0:14:26.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're up, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.98,0:14:27.89,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:30.06,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,That was great, Ushio-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:32.69,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Now Fuko's back in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:35.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Dang, when I had her cornered in well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.57,0:14:40.74,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Just from that one move, we can tell that Ushio-chan loves Fuko more than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.74,0:14:41.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:43.41,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,In your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:51.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If you were alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:04.01,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san. Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:09.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry. It was my turn, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.23,0:15:15.69,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,So you do see a sliver of your wife in Fuko after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I said that wouldn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:20.19,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Perhaps our personalities are different?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.19,0:15:23.24,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Maybe your wife was a childish person?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:26.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't name a person more childish than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:30.66,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You've never met your mother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:33.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right. She only knows her face from pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.17,0:15:37.46,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,But I heard stories from Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:41.84,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,What kind of person was your Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:43.80,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:47.01,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,A big crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:52.02,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,But a person who did her best to give birth to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:57.52,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,And, the person Daddy really loved!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.07,0:16:05.95,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:11.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She just comes back to me at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:15.58,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko has free time, so call whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.38,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko will come whenever you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:21.84,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko will do whatever Fuko can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:25.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you trying to be nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:30.52,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It's not like that; Fuko just wants to play with Ushio-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:32.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:35.98,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko will be heading home now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:38.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just say bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:40.48,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Let's go, Ushio-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:42.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:47.99,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Oh well. There will be plenty of opportunities in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:51.12,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Be careful when you go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:54.12,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko will say hi when Fuko sees you on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:59.67,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko has memorized Ushio-chan's scent, so Fuko can tell when she's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:00.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you an animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:03.51,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,When it happens, let's play together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.05,0:17:04.72,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:11.93,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Good bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.68,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup. Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:19.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.36,0:17:21.32,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,She was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:27.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's clean up and take a bath, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:27.99,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:42.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Botan doesn't get angry over that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:46.01,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I think she takes it as a back rub and likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:46.01,Default-alt,Bot,0,0,0,,Gof, gof.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.55,0:17:50.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan! Good-for-nothing's here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.35,0:17:54.93,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:56.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry I made you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:59.23,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Wow, you totally have the doting parent look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:03.07,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan, what should we do with your pathetic daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:05.99,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:09.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She has good eyes for spotting men.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:17.62,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I gave Ushio-chan a handout for\Nthe sports day, so read it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:18.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sports day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:23.71,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah. There are family events, too,\Nso you'd better practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.21,0:18:27.72,Default,San,0,0,0,,I knew about the sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:31.22,Default,San,0,0,0,,The head of the neighborhood committee told me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:33.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then will you come cheer for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:34.72,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:37.02,Default,San,0,0,0,,But rather than cheering...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.14,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Akki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:43.23,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey Ushio. Didn't know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:44.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's with that outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:48.69,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Jogging in preparation for the sports day, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:51.49,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I can't stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.49,0:18:52.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's not in the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:19:01.92,Default,San,0,0,0,,{\fs70.2}Akio-san is a fast runner, so he was asked to run anchor for the teachers in place of the principal, who has a bad waist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:04.59,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You'll be on the parent team, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:06.13,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's a showdown between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:08.84,Default,San,0,0,0,,That's a very exciting situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hold on one minute please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:12.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I haven't decided to be in the relay yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.09,0:19:16.72,Default-alt,Aki,0,0,0,,Sanae, tell the principal he'll run anchor for the parent team.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:17.89,Default,San,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.43,0:19:19.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,They're so forceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.10,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:23.48,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:29.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right! Daddy's gonna do his best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:30.61,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Do his best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:34.45,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:38.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't look pathetic when my daughter's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.14,0:19:57.22,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:00.43,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Fuko Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:04.52,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,So you like to go on strolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:05.44,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:08.69,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You're not scared of getting lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:10.32,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:17.28,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It's like you don't know which way to go,\Nand you feel unsure, are in trouble, and can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:20.12,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You're not scared of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:21.45,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.45,0:20:23.16,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:25.54,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko should learn that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:30.59,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,But Fuko thinks it's dangerous for little girls to walk outside alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:33.97,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:43.68,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It's the new hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:52.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs27\fnArial\b1\frz351.049\pos(930,85.5)\c&H693C46&}Hikarizaka General Hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:47.44,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Do you like it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:48.19,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:50.65,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.28,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Just because.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.49,0:20:55.78,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Just because, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:29.44,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's finally the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:32.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah! The day I show you who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:43.41,Default,San,0,0,0,,Ushio. We can hardly wait for tomorrow to come, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:48.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.67,0:21:52.80,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I couldn't pee alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.09,0:21:59.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ushio?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:02.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5\pos(1462.5,840)}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:43.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:43.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:48.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My family might just be getting toyed with by this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:53.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Given happiness, then having it snatched away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:04.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't even grant one wish my only daughter has?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 21
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs85.000002\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,765)\3c&H000008&\blur0.5\bord0.75}The End of the World
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.97,0:24:07.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.18,0:24:08.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What should I do?
